Z||000013||JSocha||06-11-2001||05:08 PM||||Mathmaticians!<P>Here is your assignment, if you choose to accept it (as I already have the answer).<P>It is said, that everything can have a mathmatical equation, even a sniffle.<P>Therefore, does anyone outhere know the mathmatical formula for a "SNIFFLE"?!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Here is the story:<P>Mark was attending a very prestigous University to which he attended classes regularily.  Once such class was his mathmatics class, to which he never missed a day, worked extremly hard, but was failing miserably.  The final exam for the class was only a week away which would determine his fate.<P>One day, Mark showed up for his mathmatics class with an extremly bad cold.<P>His professor, noticing how bad Marks cold was, went over to him and said "Mark, I know you have never missed a day of class, you always show up for the reviews, you attend my other math classes to see if you can make some progress, you work very hard on your assignments and you are still failing this class.  No matter what I feel you do, I do not feel you will be able to pass this class and there is no point you being here with that bad cold you have."<P>The professor went on to further say, "Mark, why don't you just go home and just get better and not worry about taking the final as it will not make a difference to your final grade if you take it.  Mark, I will also tell you that mathmatics is very easy and anything can be explained with a mathmatical formula.  Even a 'sniffle'!"<P>"Really!?", replied Mark.<P>"Yes.  Really!", replied the professor.<P>The professor continued, "Tell you what Mark, I'll make you a deal.  If you go home<BR>and can come up with the mathmatical formula before the final next week, I will pass you and give you an 'A' for this course."<P>With that Mark agreed and went home.<P>The following week and the day before the final exam, Mark excitedly went to his Professor and said, "Professor!  Professor! I figured out the formula for a 'sniffle'!"<P>The professor amazed not to mentioned extremly befuddled said, "You did?!  Well then, will you please show me?"<BR>=========================<P>Here is where you mathmaticians can show the formula/answer!  Have fun!<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
